# 11. Limitations

Our scanner cannot reliably detect:

- Polymorphic malware
- Sophisticated obfuscation
- Encrypted payloads
- Memory-only malware
- Advanced rootkits
- Sophisticated behavioral attacks
- Unknown malware with no obvious indicators

Therefore:

> **A simple Python scanner is a learning tool, not an antivirus replacement.**

