# 28. FINAL TAKEAWAY

> **A basic malware detection tool combines file hashing, static analysis, indicator matching, and heuristic scoring to identify files that deserve further investigation. Detection is not the same as confirmation: both false positives and false negatives are possible.**

### Most important formula:

```text
HASH
+
STRINGS
+
INDICATORS
+
HEURISTICS
=
BASIC MALWARE DETECTION
```

And the most important security principle:

> **Never execute an unknown sample merely to see whether your scanner detects it. Start with safe static analysis and use an isolated, authorized analysis environment for any required behavioral investigation.**